### Admin token: Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=  v1
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}

### Positive test: Admin can create new user with correct data
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

{
  "username": "Anne_1982",
  "password": "$some4Pass$",
  "role": "USER"
}

### Positive test: User can authorizied with correct data
### Authorization: Basic QW5uZV8xOTgyOiRzb21lNFBhc3Mk
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Anne_1982",
  "password": "$some4Pass$"
}

### Positive test: Authorized user can create account
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic QW5uZV8xOTgyOiRzb21lNFBhc3Mk

### Positive test: Authorized user can deposit money in account
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic QW5uZV8xOTgyOiRzb21lNFBhc3Mk

{
  "id": 3,
  "balance": 1000
}

### Negative test: authorized user cannot deposit money into a non-existent account
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic QW5uZV8xOTgyOiRzb21lNFBhc3Mk

{
  "id": 12323423435554,
  "balance": 1000
}

### Negative test: authorized user cannot deposit money into a non-existent account
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic QW5uZV8xOTgyOiRzb21lNFBhc3Mk

{
  "id": 3,
  "balance": -100
}


