}

### Positive test: Authorized user can transfer money from account id: 3 to account: 4
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic QW5uZV8xOTgyOiRzb21lNFBhc3Mk

{
  "senderAccountId": 3,
  "receiverAccountId": 4,
  "amount": 500
}

