### Positive test: check user profile
GET http://localhost:4111/api/v1/customer/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic QW5uZV8xOTgyOiRzb21lNFBhc3Mk

### Positive test: Authorized user can update his Name
PUT http://localhost:4111/api/v1/customer/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic QW5uZV8xOTgyOiRzb21lNFBhc3Mk

{
  "name": "Anne_1982UPD"
}

### Negative test: authorized user cannot change the name to blank
PUT http://localhost:4111/api/v1/customer/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic QW5uZV8xOTgyOiRzb21lNFBhc3Mk

{
  "name": ""
}

### Negative test: authorized user cannot change name less 3 characters
PUT http://localhost:4111/api/v1/customer/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic QW5uZV8xOTgyOiRzb21lNFBhc3Mk

{
  "name": "qw"
}

### Negative test: athorized user cannot change the name to digits
